-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SROIE (ICDAR 2019 Robust Reading Challenge on Scanned Receipts OCR and
Information Extraction)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The built-in model is trained in part on the SROIE dataset, released for the
ICDAR 2019 competition. If you use this dataset in your own work, please cite:

  Z. Huang, K. Chen, J. He, X. Bai, D. Karatzas, S. Lu, C. V. Jawahar,
  "ICDAR 2019 Competition on Scanned Receipt OCR and Information Extraction",
  ICDAR 2019.

Dataset: https://rrc.cvc.uab.es/?ch=13

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CORD (Consolidated Receipt Dataset) — NAVER Clova
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The built-in model is trained in part on the CORD dataset, published by
NAVER Clova under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0) license.
If you use this dataset, please cite:

  S. Park, S. Shin, B. Lee, J. Lee, J. Surh, M. Seo, H. Lee,
  "CORD: A Consolidated Receipt Dataset for Post-OCR Parsing",
  Document Intelligence Workshop at NeurIPS 2019.

Dataset: https://github.com/clovaai/cord

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Tesseract OCR
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This image bundles the Tesseract OCR engine and its language data
(tesseract-ocr, tesseract-ocr-deu, tesseract-ocr-eng), which read text from the
cleaned receipt image. Tesseract is licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Project: https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tesseract

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Generated German receipts
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The "synthetic" training source is produced offline by this project from the
public English labels above (word-level German rewrites). No additional
third-party data is involved.

The blind test set is never used for training.
